# 仓库内统一以 LF 存储文本；检出时按各机器 core.autocrlf 处理。
* text=auto

# Windows 批处理 / PowerShell 入口固定 CRLF 检出
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产：不做行尾转换，不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.task binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ply binary
*.spz binary
*.glb binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.zip binary
